  "releaseNotes": "#\n# Changed\n- Removed the extension driver's build-time dependency on AppleTVControlLibrary. The Companion Link credential conversion (ToCredentials()) that only the video server driver needs was moved out of the shared AppleTvStoredDevice model into a video-server-only extension method, so the extension driver package no longer references or merges AppleTvControlLibrary.dll.\n- No functional or behavioral change for either driver; this is an internal dependency/packaging cleanup release.\n\nSee [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/oznetmaster/AppleTVCrestronDriver/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) and the [extension driver CHANGELOG](https://github.com/oznetmaster/AppleTVCrestronDriver/blob/main/AppleTVCrestronExtensionDriver/CHANGELOG.md) for full details.",
